{"title":"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Trial_&amp;_Error)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Trial &amp; Error)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(CREATIVE_THINKING_+_ANALYSIS!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(CREATIVE THINKING + ANALYSIS!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the least possible value of the least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/1/b6129cc6a0cce24b0d303af823cb686ab6777b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }20\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }30\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }60\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }120\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"416\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We wish to find possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. By finding the greatest common factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we can find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is 3. Moving on to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, in order to minimize them, we wish to find the least such that the least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73159fc0321b4db6c6f35be06b0441f03be9f841.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />. Similarly, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be2fcddb22828af50c1d66658605d333c6a8b0c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The factors of 12 are 12,6,4,3,2,1. The factors of 15 are 1,3,5,15. The 2 numbers that repeat are 1 and 3 so b either has to be 1 or 3. If b is 3 then a is 4 and c is 5 and the least common multiple of 4 and 5 are 20. We don't have to test 1 because 20 is the lowest answer, so if b equaling 1 resulted in the least common multiple being less that 20 then the correct answer won't be there. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/a/d9aa2f88904bfcb37385ebad41007a3e201e4ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"61\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Trial_.26_Error.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Trial_&amp;_Error)\">Solution 3 (Trial &amp; Error)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Trial &amp; Error)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let's say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/6/d0626346656484834bb91047ca588571171f0b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4, b = 3, c = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" /> (because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71ee3ba49df42286d5d9a7843348eac54db939b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LCM(3,4)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/413891c91956b9006ab4f9d922995adc2176aab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LCM(3,5)=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />), this works so clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4eaa0e4ed1d915bfbbb2748cd5d508d2c5174ac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GCF(4, 5) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"168\" height=\"30\" />. ~ JasonDaMoat, ~ Minor edited by Quetzalcoatlus\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wvRmxjwOUHY?si=mNtAIGDHVdPaKWUX\">https://youtu.be/wvRmxjwOUHY?si=mNtAIGDHVdPaKWUX</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28CREATIVE_THINKING_.2B_ANALYSIS.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(CREATIVE_THINKING_+_ANALYSIS!!!)\">Video Solution(CREATIVE THINKING + ANALYSIS!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(CREATIVE THINKING + ANALYSIS!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_-xC-qQMCbk\">https://youtu.be/_-xC-qQMCbk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=2340\">https://youtu.be/HISL2-N5NVg?t=2340</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7tGFq07njVo\">https://youtu.be/7tGFq07njVo</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8\" title=\"2016 AMC 8\">2016 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"ht